```

### Typography Hierarchy

| Element         | Classes                                                         |
| --------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Display**     | `font-serif text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight`      |
| **H1**          | `font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold`                     |
| **H2**          | `font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold`                     |
