### Hover & Interaction Patterns

```tsx
// Card hover - lift + glow
className =
    'transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-gold-500/30'

// Button hover - scale + shine
className = 'transition-transform duration-200 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95'

// Link hover - color shift
className = 'text-gold-600 hover:text-gold-500 transition-colors'

// Icon hover - subtle rotation
className = 'transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-6'
```

### Gold Accent Usage

Gold is our luxury signal. Use strategically:

- ✅ Step numbers, badges, icons
- ✅ CTA button backgrounds
- ✅ Hover borders and rings
- ✅ Timeline connectors
- ❌ Large background areas
- ❌ Body text
- ❌ Overuse (dilutes impact)

