## Implementation Checklist

### Before Writing Code

- [ ] Is this a Server Component? (default: YES)
- [ ] Does existing shared component solve this?
- [ ] What's the conversion goal of this section?

### Design Quality

- [ ] **Feels expensive** — not generic or template-like
- [ ] **Typography correct** — Serif headings, tracked labels
- [ ] **Gold accents** — strategic, not excessive
- [ ] **Visual depth** — shadows, layers, glassmorphism where appropriate

### SEO & Performance

- [ ] **SSR-friendly** — no Framer Motion for content reveal
- [ ] **Semantic HTML** — `article`, `section`, `ol/ul`, proper headings
- [ ] **Accessibility** — `aria-labelledby`, `aria-label`, `alt` text
- [ ] **Content visible** — no `opacity: 0` initial states

### Mobile & Interactions

- [ ] **Mobile-first** — works on 375px screens
- [ ] **Hover states** — smooth, premium feel
- [ ] **Touch targets** — minimum 44px
- [ ] **Sticky CTAs** — mobile call/booking buttons

